ies rushing through a tunnel. In another, lasers extend from your fingertips, allowing you to slice beat-synced forms as they emerge in rhythm. \nEvery scape introduces a distinct mechanic, a new flow, a different way to interact.\n\nThe game analyzes the player\u2019s physical effort. Chaotic or imprecise movements increase fatigue and slow recovery. The more accurately actions are performed, the greater the positive impact on progression within Thetascape.\n\nYou now have the opportunity to be among the first to step into Thetascape. \nThe price is heavily reduced at launch for your convenience. \nOngoing support, updates, and direct communication are available through its official channels.\nWelcome to Thetascape.\n", "short_description": "Thetascape is a controller-free multiverse of scapes, where each scape features its own visual identity and gameplay system - fully standalone experiences connected through a shared progression system and unified statistical framework.\n\nIn one scape, you rotate a sphere and aim a laser to split incoming geometric entities rushing through a tunnel. In another, lasers extend from your fingertips, allowing you to slice beat-synced forms as they emerge in rhythm\u2026"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thetascape.com/pp.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Thetascape", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.thetascape.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, 